From 6b92ddc1892e6f26be2c8a3217de66ec5570dfe8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: tedin7 <tommasoderosa94@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 23 Nov 2026 21:52:35 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] d3d12: rectangle list geometry picks the right-angle
 corner per rectangle (the vertex opposite the longest screen edge) instead of
 assuming the first; tests for the corner at the second and third vertex and
 for a non-right triangle

(cherry picked from commit 7589af0406837ef2548cdee94d45f799de320303)
